{
  "id": "292",
  "title": "Is she at home?",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-04-19",
  "synopsis": "How do you ask if someone is at home when you make a phone call?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/397/06d410b78db51ec176af6261bd48f37fc82e75ed.mp3?1554973011",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 2: Lili’s Boyfriend",
    "chapter": 0,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "她在家吗？\n\n本：喂，我是本。丽丽在家吗？\n丽丽妈妈：她在睡觉，要我叫她吗？\n本：不用了。\n丽丽妈妈：那等会儿我叫她打电话给你。\n本：好的。谢谢！再见！\n丽丽妈妈：不客气！再见！",
    "traditional": "她在家嗎？\n\n本：喂，我是本。麗麗在家嗎？\n麗麗媽媽：她在睡覺，要我叫她嗎？\n本：不用了。\n麗麗媽媽：那等會兒我叫她打電話給你。\n本：好的。謝謝！再見！\n麗麗媽媽：不客氣！再見！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Is she at home?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：喂，我是本。丽丽在家吗？",
      "traditional": "本：喂，我是本。麗麗在家嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn wéi wǒ shì běn lì lì zài jiā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Hello, I'm Ben. Is Lili at home?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽妈妈：她在睡觉，要我叫她吗？",
      "traditional": "麗麗媽媽：她在睡覺，要我叫她嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lì lì mā ma tā zài shuì jiào yào wǒ jiào tā ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili's mother: She is sleeping, should I call for her?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：不用了。",
      "traditional": "本：不用了。",
      "pinyin": "běn bú yòng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: There's no need."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽妈妈：那等会儿我叫她打电话给你。",
      "traditional": "麗麗媽媽：那等會兒我叫她打電話給你。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì mā ma nà děng huì'r wǒ jiào tā dǎ diàn huà gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili's mother: Then I will tell her to give you a call in a while."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：好的。谢谢！再见！",
      "traditional": "本：好的。謝謝！再見！",
      "pinyin": "běn hǎo de xiè xie zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Ok. Thank you! Bye!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "丽丽妈妈：不客气！再见！",
      "traditional": "麗麗媽媽：不客氣！再見！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì mā ma bú kè qi zài jiàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili's mother: You're welcome! Bye!"
    }
  ],
